gether: 7,760 + 29,100 + 97,000. Let me add the first two first. 7,760 + 29,100. Let's see, 7,000 + 29,000 is 36,000. Then 760 + 100 is 860. Wait, no, that's not right. Wait, 29,100 plus 7,760. Breaking it down: 29,100 + 7,000 is 36,100. Then add 760 to get 36,860. Then add the last term, 97,000. .\n\n36,860 + 97,000. Adding the thousands: 36,000 + 97,000 is 133,000</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
