es 6 \\times 10 = 3996 \\times 10 = 39960\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 666 by the hundreds place digit (900) of 960:**\n   \\[\n   666 \\times 900 = 666 \\times 9 \\times 100 = 5994 \\times 100 = 599400\n   \\]\n\n4. **Sum all the step results:**\n   \\[\n   0 + 39960 + 599400 = 639360\n   \\]\n\nThus, the final computed product is \\boxed{639360}.",
