hree steps.  \n1. Multiply 309 by the **ones place digit 0** of 390:  \n   \\( 309 \\times 0 = 0 \\).  \n2. Multiply 309 by the **tens place digit 90** of 390:  \n   \\( 309 \\times 90 = (309 \\times 9) \\times 10 = 2,\\!781 \\times 10 = 27,\\!810 \\).  \n3. Multiply 309 by the **hundreds place digit 300** of 390:  \n   \\( 309 \\times 300 = (309 \\times 3) \\times 100 = 927 \\times 100 = 92,\\!700 \\).  \n\nNow, sum all the step results:  \n\\( 0 + 27,\\!810 + 92,\\!700 = 120,\\!510 \\).  \n\nSo, the final computed product is **120,510**.  \n\nThe correct answer is **120,510**, not 110,510.', ''] 42%|####2     | 210/500 [5:01:13<7:06:31, 88.25s/it]
