dd all these three results together: 2040 (from ones) + 20,400 (from tens) + 34,000 (from hundreds). Let me add them step by step. .\n\nFirst, 2040 + 20,400. Adding those gives 22,440. Then add 34,000 to that</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
