732,800 (from the hundreds).\nPlus 9,160 (from the tens).\nPlus 916 (from the ones).\n\nAdding the first two: 732,800 + 9,160. Let's do that step by step. 732,800 + 9,000 is 741,800, then add 160 more: 741,800 + 160 = 741,960. .\n\nNow add the last part, 916: 741,960 + 916</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
