600 (from the tens) + 395,000 (from the hundreds). Let me add them step by step. .\n\nFirst, 2370 + 31,600. Adding those gives 33,970. Then adding 395,000 to that: 33,970 + 395,000. Hmm, 33,970 + 395,000</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
