       265\n    x 807\n    -------\n      1855   (265 x 7)\n    +0000    (265 x 0, shifted one position)\n   +212000   (265 x 8, shifted two positions)\n    ---------\n    Total: 213,855\n\nYes, that's correct. So the user's answer of 212,855 is missing the 1,000. Probably they added 212,000 + 855 instead of 1,855. So the correct answer is 213,855. Therefore, I need to present that in the template properly.\n</think>\n\n",
