dreds place digit (100):\n   \\[\n   842 \\times 100 = 84200\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum all the results from the steps above:\n\\[\n842 + 33680 + 84200\n\\]\n\nAdding these step by step:\n\\[\n842 + 33680 = 34522\n\\]\n\\[\n34522 + 84200 = 118722\n\\]\n\nThus, the final computed product is \\(\\boxed{118722}\\).",
