,000 + 1,800 = 145,800\n\n145,800 + 11,900 = 157,700\n\n157,700 + 340 = 158,040\n\n158,040 + 153 = 158,193. Yep, same result. So the correct answer is 158,193, not 158,893. The user's thought might be wrong. Therefore, I should explain the correct steps leading to 158,193 and point out the discrepancy.\n</think>\n\n",
