n\nAdding all together:70,800 +56,640 =127,440; 127,440 +4,956 =132,396. Yep.\n\nHmm, so definitely the correct answer is 132,396, not 132,399. Therefore, the user might have made an error in their calculation. But according to their problem, they want me to solve it in the given template. Let me check the template again:\n\nThe template is:\n\n",
